    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional 12-Acre Equine Property in Brocurrow, Adamstown, Co. Wexford.\n\nA beautifully presented and extremely private circa 12.4-acre equine holding in Brocurrow, Adamstown, Co. Wexford, combining a fully refurbished traditional Wexford farmhouse with exceptional equestrian facilities, breathtaking lands and a beautiful south-facing garden and patio.\n\nThis is a truly special property where the beauty of the surrounding countryside is perfectly complemented by a charming and beautifully designed traditional farmhouse. Offering an exceptional balance of comfortable family living, privacy, character and outstanding equestrian potential, the property presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey holding in a peaceful and highly private setting.\n\nThe property is ideally suited to part-time farming enthusiasts, private horse owners, a sale-preparation yard or competition yard, with excellent facilities and beautifully maintained lands providing an ideal environment for both horses and their owners.\n\nThe approximately 12.4 acres of land are laid out in a number of beautiful post-and-rail grass paddocks, creating an impressive and visually striking setting around the farmhouse. The lands are complemented by horse-safe boundaries throughout, while a dedicated all-weather exercise arena provides excellent year-round schooling and exercise facilities.\n\nThe equestrian infrastructure includes stables, a substantial barn and a range of traditional stone outhouses, all maintained to an excellent standard and perfectly complementing the character and charm of this exceptional holding.\n\nAt the heart of the property is a beautiful traditional Wexford farmhouse, which has been fully refurbished while carefully retaining its original character and charm. Designed and finished with great attention to detail, the home combines attractive stone features and period character with modern comfort, creating a warm and welcoming home that is both practical and full of personality.\n\nThe spacious accommodation includes three generously proportioned bedrooms, providing comfortable living accommodation and plenty of space for family life. Each area of the home has been thoughtfully presented, resulting in a property that feels both charming and comfortable while retaining the unique character expected from a traditional farmhouse of this calibre.\n\nOutside, the south-facing garden and patio provide a wonderful space to relax and enjoy the peace, privacy and beautiful surroundings of the property. With breathtaking views across the lands and an exceptional sense of tranquillity, this is a home and holding that must be experienced in person to be fully appreciated.\n\nThe combination of a beautifully refurbished farmhouse, extraordinary lands, extensive equestrian facilities and complete privacy makes this a particularly attractive and versatile property.\n\nProperty Highlights:\n- Approximately 12.4 acres of beautifully maintained land\n- Fully refurbished traditional Wexford farmhouse\n- Spacious three-bedroom accommodation\n- Attractive stone and period features throughout\n- Extremely private and peaceful setting\n- Breathtaking post-and-rail grassland paddocks\n- Horse-safe boundaries\n- All-weather exercise arena\n- Stables and substantial barn\n- Traditional stone outhouses\n- Beautiful south-facing garden and patio\n- Outstanding equestrian potential\n- Suitable for private use, part-time farming, sale preparation or a competition yard\n\nA rare opportunity to acquire a truly exceptional turnkey equine holding in excellent condition. Combining extraordinary lands, a beautifully presented traditional farmhouse, superb equestrian facilities and complete privacy, this is a very special property to come to the market and one that will appeal to buyers seeking something genuinely unique.\n\nFor the right buyer, this remarkable Wexford property offers an exceptional lifestyle opportunity where beautiful countryside, comfortable living and outstanding equestrian facilities come together in perfect harmony.\n\nViewing by appointment with Auctioneer Joe Bishop."
      },
